  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk / Tax Collector | Merrimack, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n\t\t\t Search \n     About   \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards   \t\t\t \n     Community Links   \t\t\t \n     Stay Informed  \t\t\t \n     Find It Fast   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Boat Registrations \r\n\t\t\t Civil Unions \r\n\t\t\t Dog Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Dredge and Fill Permits \r\n\t\t\t Elections & Voting \r\n\t\t\t Marriage Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Motor Vehicle - Registration Renewals \r\n\t\t\t Motor Vehicle Registration - New Purchase \r\n\t\t\t Motor Vehicle Registration - resident moved from within NH \r\n\t\t\t Motor Vehicle Registrations - Resident New to NH \r\n\t\t\t Property Taxes \r\n\t\t\t Vital Records \r\n\t\t\t Absentee Ballot Request Application 2026 \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk / Tax Collector \r\nTown Clerk / Tax Collector\t\t \r\nWelcome to the Town Clerk/Tax Collector's Office, the direct link between the residents of the community of Merrimack and their government. The entire recorded history of Merrimack and its people is kept in this office. It is also where numerous services are provided to the community.  \nOur mission is to provide friendly, efficient, and accurate service to our customers. \nStaff \nBrenda DuLong , Town Clerk / Tax Collector \nRobin Smith, Deputy Town Clerk Tax Collector \nAnnette Handy, Assistant Town Clerk/Tax Collector       \nAlexa Levesque, Assistant Town Clerk/Tax Collector       \nPeter Hodges, Assistant Town Clerk/Tax Collector \nCaitlin Curran, Assistant Town Clerk/Tax Collector      \r\nContact Us \r\n\t\t\t\t\tBrenda  DuLong\r\nTown Clerk / Tax Collector \r\nPhone:  603-424-3651  \r\nMore Information \r\nTown Clerk / Tax Collector \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n View Map \t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t 6 Baboosic Lake Road  \n\t\t\t\t\t Merrimack ,  NH   03054 \r\n6 Baboosic Lake Road   Merrimack NH 03054 \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t Directions \r\nPhone:  (603) 424-3651 \r\nFax: (603) 423-8539 \r\nHours \n9:00 AM - 4:30 PM \nMonday - Friday  \r\nDirectory \r\n\t\t\t Taxes & Online Payments \r\n\t\t\t Report an Issue \r\n\t\t\t Permits & Forms \r\n\t\t\t Assessment Database \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Meetings \r\n\t\t\t Position Openings \r\nContact Us \r\nMerrimack Town Hall \r\n6 Baboosic Lake Road \r\nMerrimack, NH 03054 \r\n(603) 424-2331 \r\nSocial Media \n\t\t\t Facebook \r\n\t\t\t Nixle \r\n\t\t\t See Click Fix \r\nHelpful Links \r\n         Town Holidays \n         Minutes & Agendas \n         Social Media - Town Departments \n         Vital Records \n         Local Weather \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Contact Us \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
